{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["לא תלך רכיל — one who goes around in towns, going to speak lashon hara from this one to that one. And the Targum: לא תיכול קורצין — you shall not proclaim gossip. So too in Daniel: אכלו קורציהון דיהודאי — they proclaimed. And so ירעם משמים is translated אכלי מן שמיא — the language of making a sound heard." "לא תעמוד על דם רעך — do not stand aside, but allow yourself to save him at the life of the pursuer."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:49:04.506371268Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}